{#- The shadow list decider's input (subconscious/concern_list_shadow.py). Expects agent_input: now (UTC ISO),
    concern (the record as the live decider read it, concern_planner.concern_text), looked_up [text], entries
    [{id, what, who_acts, assistant_part, when_local, why}], correction. -#}
{%- set A = agent_input -%}
Now: {{ A.now | local_time }}

########## THE CONCERN ##########
{{ A.concern }}

########## LOOKED UP JUST NOW ##########
{% for t in A.looked_up -%}
- {{ t }}
{% else -%}
(nothing)
{% endfor %}
########## ON THE LIST NOW ##########
{% for e in A.entries -%}
[{{ e.id }}] {{ e.what }} | who acts: {{ e.who_acts }} | the assistant: {{ e.assistant_part }} | when: {{ e.when_local }}
    why: {{ e.why }}
{% else -%}
(nothing yet)
{% endfor %}
{% if A.correction %}
## Your previous answer was refused
{{ A.correction }}
{% endif %}
Answer every entry on the list now by its id, then add what the concern needs that nothing covers.
